Homepage: https://pkg.haus

Package: pkghaus-archive-keyring
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: OpenPGP archive keyring for apt.pkg.haus
 The keys apt uses to verify the pkg.haus APT archive. Installing this
 package keeps the trust anchor current: key rotations ship as ordinary
 package updates, signed by a key the system already trusts, so apt
 keeps working across a rotation with no manual step.
